---
// Orange gradient "about" band.
---

<section class="band pad" id="about">
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h2>We've run programs. We built the tool we always wanted.</h2>
    <p>
      Athletic Connect is basketball-first and built alongside real clubs —
      because the best youth sports software should give directors and coaches
      their time back, not add another system to babysit.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .band {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--orange), var(--orange-2));
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .band h2 {
    color: #fff;
  }
  .band p {
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 0.95;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
</style>
